## `$ ls ./projects`

:::columns
:::column 0.25
**🧠 Memory & Systems**

- **[ft_malloc](https://github.com/Univers42/ft_malloc)** — `malloc` / `free` / `realloc` on top of `mmap`, zone-based allocation
- **[catch_error](https://github.com/Univers42/catch_error)** — Zero-overhead error-handling framework for C
- **[ft_linux](https://github.com/Univers42/ft_linux)** — A full Linux system built from source (LFS)
:::

:::column 0.25
**⚙️ Processes & Concurrency**

- **[mini_shell](https://github.com/Univers42/mini_shell)** — Bash-like shell: pipes, redirections, heredocs, built-ins, signals
- **[philosopher](https://github.com/Univers42/philosopher)** — Dining philosophers with threads & mutexes, no data races, no deadlocks
- **[Examen42](https://github.com/Univers42/Examen42)** — Exam rank 02–04 solutions
:::

:::column 0.25
**🎨 Graphics**

- **[minirt](https://github.com/Univers42/minirt)** — Ray tracer: ray–object intersections, lighting, shadows
- **fdf** — Wireframe 3D terrain renderer
- **push_swap** — Stack-based sorting under strict operation limits
:::

:::column 0.25
**🐳 Infra & Web**

- **[transcendence](https://github.com/Univers42/transcendence)** — Real-time full-stack capstone, 5-person team
- **[mini-baas](https://github.com/Univers42/mini-baas)** — Mini Backend-as-a-Service, side project
- **[Inception](https://github.com/Univers42/Inception)** — NGINX + WordPress + MariaDB, each in its own container
:::
:::

